trike\">simulator developers</span> in 8 different ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visitors who don't like each other but want fresh urine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies who don't like you, visitors or urine. They like to attack. That's it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different kinds of piss for different tastes: political, anime, meme, etc.</p></li></ul>",
